        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9025/254, 10 Inch New Yorker Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe New Yorker 10 Inch Cabinet Pull is available in satin brass, antique brass, oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, polished nickel, and polished chrome finishes. These modern finishes accentuate the chicness of the New Yorker 10 Inch Cabinet Pull. This contemporary kitchen cabinet pull is large enough for use on the biggest cabinets, but it can also be used as a furniture pull. It comes package with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9025\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-4-inch-mid-century-modern-cabinet-hardware-omnia-9025-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-6-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-8-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-12-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-18-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9025 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
